  unitName: Skeleton King
  unitId: 60051
  unitNumber: 78
  description: An undead monster that moves freely thanks to the power of darkness
    in its bones. It gains experience and wisdom through battle. Its combat ability
    is greatly enhanced due to having learned it can equip armor and a shield. It
    is more hostile towards the living, and more than group victories, it tends to
    strongly wish for its opponents' death.
